          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ভীষণ (bhīshôn) is Sanskrit bhīṣaṇa, terrifying (Monier-Williams). Bengali speech uses it as English uses 'terribly', for anything extreme, good or bad."
            }
